<title>USA: Bear, Stearns names Dolph head of high-yld trading.</title>
<headline>Bear, Stearns names Dolph head of high-yld trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns Cos Inc unit Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc has named Scott Dolph as head of its high-yield bond trading group, said Paul Greenberg, director of high-yield research.</p>
<p>Dolph, 37, has worked at Bear, Stearns for 15 years, 10 of which he has been involved in trading operations, Greenberg said. He replaces Peter Wilson, who recently resigned to become director of high-yield trading at Montgomery Securities.</p>
<p>((--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
